<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center"><B><FONT ID="s1_004"></FONT>THE OFFERING</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center"><B>&#160;</B></P>

