    <TD><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt">&#183;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">risks related to our international operations and currency exchange fluctuations; and</FONT></TD></TR>
