<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">(1) As of December 31, 2025, Edward Lee was the Chairman
of our Board of Directors.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">(2) As of March 27, 2026, Michael Pope was appointed
as the Chairman of our Board of Directors.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"></P>

