    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">in transactions through broker-dealers that agree with the Selling Stockholder to sell a specified number of such securities at a stipulated price per security;</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&#160;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&#160;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&#160;</FONT></TD></TR>
