<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;&#160;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The tax effect of temporary differences that give
rise to a significant portion of the deferred tax assets and liabilities at December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024 is presented below:</P>

